  "post_content": "<p>La Banda Joven de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia de Onda, dirigida por Vicente Julio Navarro Porcar, particip&oacute; la noche de ayer s&aacute;bado en el II Festival de Bandas Juveniles Vila de Nules.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/07/DSC00342.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 321px\" /></p>\n<p>Adem&aacute;s de la Banda Joven ondense paraticiparon la de la Uni&oacute;n Musical&nbsp;Lira Saguntina,la Banda Juvenil de Segorbe y la Banda Juvenil Art&iacute;stica Nulense.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bandajoveondaanules/dsc00271.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bandajoveondaanules/dsc00277.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bandajoveondaanules/dsc00278.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bandajoveondaanules/dsc00286.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bandajoveondaanules/dsc00289.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bandajoveondaanules/dsc00304.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bandajoveondaanules/dsc00306.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bandajoveondaanules/dsc00310.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bandajoveondaanules/dsc00316.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC